meta {
  name: Members - Change role
  type: http
  seq: 64
}

patch {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/members/<member user cuid>
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "role": "moderator"
  }
}

docs {
  Changes the role of a member (#1242): admin, moderator or member. Owner, admins, and moderators with the manage_members right (ADR 0017). Role hierarchy: nobody changes the owner; nobody acts on a member with their own role or a higher one; the new role is lower than the role of the caller (only the owner makes admins). Get a member cuid with Members - List. Returns the member with the new role.
}
